# Normalise every text file to LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# `eol=lf` rather than plain `text=auto`, because `text=auto` still hands
# Windows a CRLF working tree. This repository ports from C sources and quotes
# byte-level evidence in its documentation; a line ending that differs between
# checkouts is one more thing that can make a comparison lie.
#
# Same reasoning as DNX/.gitattributes, which was written after a test passed
# on the author's tree and failed on a fresh clone for exactly this reason.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Not text, whatever a heuristic decides. None of these belong in this
# repository — they live in the gitignored corpus — but a stray one must not be
# line-ending-mangled on its way to an instrument.
*.syx binary
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
